2c.png", "id": "1648042663186646", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619668_1648042666519979_3340728336771045194_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P1jWyVYlC2AQ7kNvwFYF6tG&_nc_oc=AdoaBIpCRhGA7Q_idf83CHFwbgGY2FVPvkxJ962YUfIgReLFBw0KGXMmXmIKPqmcu4c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLol_Iwip8c_gIttF2d79T7PUNbIyC06ZwbAd-3QwfndA&oe=6ABBE457"}, "display_name": "CatTag: Create", "keywords": ["gorilla", "cat", "tag", "cattag", "create"], "long_description": "# About CatTag: Create\nCatTag: Create is a multiplayer VR sandbox game about movement, building, and playing together. Use both hands to move through the world with cat-like VR locomotion, join other players online, and create custom spaces using the in-game map editor.\n\nBuild your own worlds, test them in VR, and use interactive systems such as physics, animations, collision events, and programmable circuits to create different kinds of gameplay.\n\n# What You Can Do\n\n- **Play in multiplayer VR** - Join other players in shared VR spaces and explore custom worlds together.\n- **Move with your hands** - Use hand-based locomotion to climb, jump, and move through environments in a physical VR style.\n- **Create custom maps** - Use the built-in map editor to place blocks and design your own rooms, obstacles, and playable spaces.\n- **Add physics interactions** - Configure blocks with physics behavior to make objects move, fall, collide, or react inside the world.\n- **Create animations** - Add animated elements to your maps to build moving platforms, interactive scenery, or timed challenges.\n- **Use collision events** - Trigger actions when players or objects touch specific blocks, allowing maps to react to what happens during play.\n- **Build programmable circuits** - Connect logic systems to create custom rules, mechanisms, puzzles, minigames, and interactive experiences.\n\nCatTag: Create is designed for players who want to build, experiment, and play user-made VR spaces with others.", "short_description": "CatTag: Create is a multiplayer VR sandbox game where players use hand-based movement to explore, build, and play custom worlds together. Create maps with physics blocks, animations, collision events, and programmable circuits."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cattag.cn/privacy5.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "haha sudio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://cattag.cn/privacy5.txt", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1725996564472128"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "26557676960549718"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1944086529477996"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1944086529477996"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1777036680, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1944086529477996"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28415888844728511", "version": "2.20"}, "id": "204059018950512", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {